## What's happening?
**{{value}} requests** over `{{protocol.name}}` in pipeline `{{pipeline_name.name}}` exceeded the 30 second processing timeout during the last 15 minutes, and OPW returned HTTP 503. This points downstream: the pipeline could not accept the batch in time. Unlike load shedding, a timeout also drops the unsent part of the batch and increments `component_discarded_events_total` with `intentional:false`.
{{/is_alert}}
{{#is_recovery}}`{{protocol.name}}` requests stopped timing out in pipeline `{{pipeline_name.name}}`.{{/is_recovery}}

